TITLE:: ParaEQGUI
summary:: one eq in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>ParaEQ
related:: Classes/ParaEQ, Classes/ParaEQPanel, Classes/FxHintBar

DESCRIPTION::
A link::Classes/ParaEQPanel:: in the window every effect has (FxDeviceGUI, 960 x
560): the panel, and one line along the bottom - the hint at the left, where the eq
is running at the right ("bus 4 · 2 ch · on"). What code::eq.gui:: opens. While it
is open the analysis runs and the eq's node says its levels; closing it stops both
and leaves the eq itself untouched.

code::
e = ParaEQ.onBus(0, 2);
e.gui;                        // or ParaEQGUI(e)
e.guiObj.close;
::

